
Creates a new instance and sets the property values for the new instance.
USAGE:

CREATE <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

NOTE: Create cannot be used to create a new class.

The following properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
BankLabel                          	N/A                 	N/A       
Capacity                           	N/A                 	N/A       
DataWidth                          	N/A                 	N/A       
Description                        	N/A                 	N/A       
DeviceLocator                      	N/A                 	N/A       
FormFactor                         	N/A                 	N/A       
HotSwappable                       	N/A                 	N/A       
InstallDate                        	N/A                 	N/A       
InterleaveDataDepth                	N/A                 	N/A       
InterleavePosition                 	N/A                 	N/A       
Manufacturer                       	N/A                 	N/A       
MemoryType                         	N/A                 	N/A       
Model                              	N/A                 	N/A       
Name                               	N/A                 	N/A       
OtherIdentifyingInfo               	N/A                 	N/A       
PartNumber                         	N/A                 	N/A       
PositionInRow                      	N/A                 	N/A       
PoweredOn                          	N/A                 	N/A       
Removable                          	N/A                 	N/A       
Replaceable                        	N/A                 	N/A       
SKU                                	N/A                 	N/A       
SerialNumber                       	N/A                 	N/A       
Speed                              	N/A                 	N/A       
Status                             	N/A                 	N/A       
Tag                                	N/A                 	N/A       
TotalWidth                         	N/A                 	N/A       
TypeDetail                         	N/A                 	N/A       
Version                            	N/A                 	N/A       

